  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- The caller should not call Prefetch anymore.\n- By default the endpoint /health is returning 200 or 500 with the overall status only.\n- A new /health-detailed endpoint is configured with the former behavior.\n- New BaseHealthController can be inherited to provide standardized controller-based health with 2 endpoints.\n- New option AfterRuntimeServiceActivation allows to execute code before app.Run() only if the app is running in default mode.\n- New option AllowOptionsTestAtBuildTime controls if the app startup will test options at built-time as well.\n- New option HealthCheckPath and HealthCheckDetailedPath allow to override default health endpoints.\n- New option HealthCheckErrorStatusCode allows to override the status code used for unsuccessful health checks.\n- By default the app startup will not test options if it isn't detecting a normal app start (runtime).\n- New extensions for HealthReport.\n- OpenAPI config extension will add 500 default response only if none was defined explicitely.\n- Base controllers are documenting results with attributes now.",
